===Etymology===
From American {{bor|en|es|abulón}}, from an indigenous language of the Monterey Bay area such as Rumsen/{{der|en|css|aulun|aūlun|red abalone}}<ref>{{R:Dictionary.com}}</ref><ref>{{R:Merriam Webster Online}}</ref>
