{{en-noun|-|s}}

# {{lb|en|North America|Australia}} An edible [[univalve]] [[mollusc]] of the genus {{taxfmt|Haliotis|genus}}, having a shell lined with [[mother-of-pearl]]. {{defdate|from mid-19th c.}}<ref>{{R:SOED5|page=1}}</ref>
# {{lb|en|North America|Australia}} The meat of the aforementioned mollusc. {{defdate|from mid-19th c.}}

